    pub fn receiveChannelAlloc(self: *Client, allocator: std.mem.Allocator, channel: []const u8) ![]u8 { if (channel.len == 0) return error.InvalidPubSubMessage; const address = std.Io.net.IpAddress.resolve(self.io, self.options.host, self.options.port) catch return error.RedisUnavailable; var stream = address.connect(self.io, .{ .mode = .stream }) catch return error.RedisUnavailable; defer stream.close(self.io); try self.authenticate(stream); const request = try encodeCommandAlloc(self.allocator, &.{ "SUBSCRIBE", channel }); defer self.allocator.free(request); try writeAll(stream, self.io, request); var subscribed = try readResp(self.allocator, stream, self.io, self.options.max_reply_bytes); defer subscribed.deinit(self.allocator); var message = try readResp(self.allocator, stream, self.io, self.options.max_reply_bytes); defer message.deinit(self.allocator); const fields = switch (message) { .array => |value| value, else => return error.InvalidRedisReply }; if (fields.len != 3 or !std.mem.eql(u8, try stringResponse(fields[0]), "message")) return error.InvalidRedisReply; return allocator.dupe(u8, try stringResponse(fields[2])); }
    pub fn publish(self: *Client, message: zstd.Broker.Message) !u64 { if (message.subject.len == 0 or message.idempotency_key.len == 0) return error.InvalidMessage; const stream = try self.streamKeyAlloc(message.subject); defer self.allocator.free(stream); const index = try std.fmt.allocPrint(self.allocator, "{s}:idem", .{stream}); defer self.allocator.free(index); const script = "local id=redis.call('HGET',KEYS[2],ARGV[1]); if id then return id end; id=redis.call('XADD',KEYS[1],'*','payload',ARGV[2],'key',ARGV[1]); redis.call('HSET',KEYS[2],ARGV[1],id); return id"; var response = try self.command(&.{ "EVAL", script, "2", stream, index, message.idempotency_key, message.payload }); defer response.deinit(self.allocator); const id = try stringResponse(response); return streamSequence(id); }
    pub fn pollAlloc(self: *Client, allocator: std.mem.Allocator, subject: []const u8, consumer: []const u8, visibility_ms: u64) !?zstd.Broker.Delivery { if (consumer.len == 0 or visibility_ms == 0) return error.InvalidConsumeRequest; const stream = try self.streamKeyAlloc(subject); defer self.allocator.free(stream); const group = try std.fmt.allocPrint(self.allocator, "{s}:group", .{self.options.namespace}); defer self.allocator.free(group); const delayed = try std.fmt.allocPrint(self.allocator, "{s}:delayed", .{stream}); defer self.allocator.free(delayed); const delayed_data = try std.fmt.allocPrint(self.allocator, "{s}:data", .{delayed}); defer self.allocator.free(delayed_data); var created = self.command(&.{ "XGROUP", "CREATE", stream, group, "0", "MKSTREAM" }) catch |err| switch (err) { error.Redis_BUSY_GROUP => null, else => return err }; if (created) |*response| response.deinit(self.allocator); const promote_script = "local t=redis.call('TIME'); local now=t[1]*1000+math.floor(t[2]/1000); local due=redis.call('ZRANGEBYSCORE',KEYS[2],'-inf',now,'LIMIT',0,16); for _,m in ipairs(due) do local p=redis.call('HGET',KEYS[3],m..':payload'); local k=redis.call('HGET',KEYS[3],m..':key'); local a=redis.call('HGET',KEYS[3],m..':attempt'); if p and k then redis.call('XADD',KEYS[1],'*','payload',p,'key',k,'attempt',a or '2') end; redis.call('HDEL',KEYS[3],m..':payload',m..':key',m..':attempt'); redis.call('ZREM',KEYS[2],m) end; return #due"; var promoted = try self.command(&.{ "EVAL", promote_script, "3", stream, delayed, delayed_data }); promoted.deinit(self.allocator); const visibility = try numberAlloc(self.allocator, visibility_ms); defer self.allocator.free(visibility); var claimed = try self.command(&.{ "XAUTOCLAIM", stream, group, consumer, visibility, "0-0", "COUNT", "1" }); defer claimed.deinit(self.allocator); if (try deliveryFromAutoClaimAlloc(allocator, subject, claimed)) |delivery| return delivery; var fresh = try self.command(&.{ "XREADGROUP", "GROUP", group, 